<title>PHILIPPINES: FDC 1996 net profit surges.</title>
<headline>FDC 1996 net profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31.</p>
<p>		  (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Revenues			    1,074 vs 99.021</p>
<p>    Net income			  4,033 vs 908.916</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Filinvest Development Corp (FDC). Based on the statement of income, the company said revenue from real estate operations surged 177 percent to 5.59 billion pesos last year from 2.02 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
